			"notes": "**Minecraft 26.x | Fabric and NeoForge**\n\nHighlights every occurrence of a block pattern near you. Patterns are built from\nper-cell predicates (block ids, tags, alternations, any-block and negations),\nand several can be searched for at once, each in its own colour.\n\nEntirely client-side: it reads blocks the client already has and draws boxes\nlocally, so it is safe on servers that do not have it installed.\n\n- `blockgrep-fabric-26.0.0.jar` — Fabric (requires [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api))\n- `blockgrep-neoforge-26.0.0.jar` — NeoForge"
